  "story": {
    "day": 56,
    "title": "Kaya's Special Dinner",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya wanted to make dinner today.",
      "She decided to make healthy rolls.",
      "First, she put out cucumber and crab meat.",
      "She knew her dear parents loved these.",
      "She didn't have any tuna.",
      "Kaya remembered an interesting cooking program.",
      "A famous chef was its hero.",
      "He didn't serve food in a restaurant.",
      "She learned many ideas as she watched his interview.",
      "So, she thought, \"We can go and use taco chicken.\"",
      "Her parents came home. Kaya said, \"Welcome home! They're for you.\"",
      "\"Our daughter is a chef!\" they replied."
    ]
  }
}